WEBVTT

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:35.400
You cannot defeat the Cabernet 
as you are now, Lag Seeing.

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:38.280
Shindan Loaded!

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:41.910
The shindan...

00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:45.020
I can't load a shindan!

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:46.390
Why?

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:48.250
You are wandering, lost.

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:51.770
There is nothing to be afraid of.

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:54.050
I will give you it to you...

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:56.300
...your true heart.

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:05.100
Neither Malice, Nor Hatred

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:09.890
Lag Seeing... Right now, the heart 
known as hatred is budding within you.

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:11.640
It is not something to be saddened by.

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:13.670
Rather, you should welcome it!

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:21.120
You still do not know how to 
control that hatred, that anger...

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:25.380
And so, I will teach you.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:43.930
I will rob you of your life.

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:50.350
Hatred, anger...

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:53.900
Those are humans' most powerful heart.

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:59.020
No... I'm not like that...

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:00.900
You hate us...

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:06.320
You hate Reverse, and you hate 
Gauche who sold his soul to us...

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:10.830
But that malice should not 
be directed at Reverse.

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:15.290
What is it your hatred 
should be aimed toward?

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:21.760
I want to deliver people's hearts...

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:25.770
It is the Amberground government 
that steals people's hearts.

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:28.740
Gauche's heart was also stolen.

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:31.810
As well as that of your 
mother, Anne Seeing...

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:43.050
Come, serve me.

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:46.440
Thrust your hatred into your true enemy.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:05.660
The Cabernet is reacting 
to the heart and awakening?

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:11.100
Those are... Blue Thorns!

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:18.840
I can sense your straightforward hatred.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:23.070
But it is the same as mine. 
It will not cause me to waver!

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:26.700
It's over, Zazie.

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:37.670
T-This is...

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:54.270
I see... So this is why you shot my 
body with your shindans, Zazie...

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:03.540
Zazie!

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:04.750
You okay?

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:08.260
I'm fine...

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:12.420
All that's left is to 
finish off the Cabernet.

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:21.440
Those are...

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:25.280
That little doggie's... Jeel's heart.

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:43.030
Where am I?

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:46.730
Who... Who am I?

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:52.070
What is this stench?

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:54.060
It's so horrible...

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:04.280
Hey, you! Hang in there!

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:06.330
You alive?

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:10.410
Hey! Are you okay? Come on!

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:17.180
Is this the stench of death?

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:29.400
Stars!

00:06:37.900 --> 00:06:39.180
We've made it out.

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:42.460
It'll be okay now. You...

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:03.500
And her?

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:06.460
She is now human-shaped petrified wood.

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:10.900
What the hell was that place?

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:12.600
Who am I?

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:14.540
Where am I? Where is she?

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:17.620
You are one who was unable to become spirit.

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:22.800
And this is the anti-government 
organization, Reverse.

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:24.380
Reverse?

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:30.620
We are also survivors from that trash heap.

00:07:30.620 --> 00:07:35.400
We join with each other in order to fight 
back against the people who abandoned us there.

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:39.140
No matter who they might be...

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:44.400
I... I hate the ones who stole my heart!

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:45.580
I will break them!

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:47.750
I will destroy them!

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:03.670
Zazie!

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:07.670
Damn you... You had to 
go showin' me that, huh?

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:19.920
Zazie...

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:21.310
Stay still.

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:31.480
Zazie!

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:35.800
Niche, wait here.

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:37.760
Wasiolka, watch over Niche, okay?

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:38.760
Lag!

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:52.360
It's a blessing that the Cabernet is safe.

00:08:52.890 --> 00:08:55.260
Noir, you failed us.

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:58.020
It's that Bee boy!

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:01.260
He's alive?

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:05.990
I'm a member of Reverse. I 
believe I proved that to you.

00:09:05.990 --> 00:09:10.480
Well, no matter. Thanks to you 
I found something interesting.

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:15.300
Lag Seeing... He will make 
an excellent Marauder.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:17.300
I want him in my possession.

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:22.010
As you wish. He went after Jeel...

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:27.040
You know his smell, yes?

00:09:27.470 --> 00:09:31.040
The smell of the person who escaped 
from the same place you did...

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:33.300
You'll do this for us, right?

00:09:49.870 --> 00:09:51.270
Are you okay?

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:52.650
Um...

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:54.100
What are trying to do?

00:09:58.110 --> 00:09:59.230
Zazie!

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:01.030
Don't get all excited...

00:10:01.570 --> 00:10:03.980
Zazie saved you!

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:06.220
Why did you save me?

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:09.180
I saw what was in your heart.

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:11.210
Pity, then?

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:12.440
No...

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:19.130
It's just as you said... Both of us 
are similar, driven by our hatred.

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:21.340
Hatred?

00:10:22.940 --> 00:10:25.810
Don't think we'll be friends though...

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:37.820
We gotta climb up here...

00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:41.010
Leave him.

00:10:41.010 --> 00:10:44.650
We're gonna have to go at it again anyway.

00:10:44.650 --> 00:10:46.000
But, that's...

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:46.960
Let's go.

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:58.830
Zazie! Rest a little, okay?

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:01.590
I ain't gonna lose to that guy!

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:15.980
Now we're even.

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:18.990
I don't remember askin' you for help!

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:36.430
So when we reach the top, you're 
really going to fight again?

00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:37.690
Of course!

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:41.630
I will not allow you to harm the Cabernet.

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:44.500
I'm gonna kill every single last gaichuu!

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:51.900
Jeel-san... After what happened to you, 
I understand why you hate the government.

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:54.150
As well as why Zazie hates the gaichuu...

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:58.400
But that's why... That's why there's 
something wrong about the two of you fighting!

00:11:58.700 --> 00:12:02.650
Can't you put aside your hatred?

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:05.660
Try asking Zazie the same thing.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:13.080
Even though I really think 
you could be friends...

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:14.770
Instead you have this mutual hatred...

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:28.440
That person called Lawrence said 
that I had hatred within me.

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:32.100
And that unless I used its power, 
I couldn't shoot a shindan.

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:34.200
But...

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:43.730
I knew one of the same 
type could sniff you out.

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:52.390
Don't tell me... They even used children...?

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:53.590
Get rid of them.

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:59.130
I told you to get rid of the government's 
lapdogs... Those Letter Bees.

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:01.660
Wait a minute! But he 
said to bring back Lag...

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:04.420
We don't need any more suspicious 
outsiders coming in.

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:06.500
We're all he needs.

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:13.310
I... I...

00:13:14.130 --> 00:13:16.350
I can't rid myself of it!

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:23.400
Until the artificial sun falls out of 
the sky, I will never lose this hatred!

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:41.290
I was tired of waiting, Lag!

00:13:43.030 --> 00:13:44.550
Sorry about this, Wasiolka.

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:46.840
Thanks, Niche.

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:50.490
It's my job. I'm your dingo.

00:13:50.490 --> 00:13:54.140
Niche, is that overgrown dragonfly 
still in the same place?

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:55.950
Overgrown Dragon...?

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:58.410
That gaichuu... Cabernet.

00:13:58.410 --> 00:13:59.650
It's still sleeping.

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:02.000
I see. As I thought...

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.610
It hasn't completely recovered yet!

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:05.660
Zazie?

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:08.400
That Jeel bastard is waiting for me.

00:14:17.470 --> 00:14:19.040
Nice work there, girly!

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:30.720
Handle things here, Niche!

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.210
Wait, Zazie!

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:46.110
Sorry I'm late, Jeel...

00:14:57.630 --> 00:15:00.640
Stop it Jeel-san! Zazie!

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:06.560
The reason you fight is to protect the 
survivors of the ones who couldn't become spirit.

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:09.030
That's not hatred at all!

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:10.390
You're wrong!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:13.960
That's why I'm going to shoot!

00:15:13.960 --> 00:15:18.040
Don't do it, Zazie! A shindan 
full of hatred isn't going to...

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:19.410
I told you already.

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:22.390
You cannot make me waiver.

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:32.790
What... is this?

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:40.170
Why? Why does your hatred affect me so?

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:45.950
The heart in that Blue Thorn I shot 
was neither malice, nor hatred...

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:49.940
It was the sadness of being 
forced to shoot my friend...

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:52.970
Sadness?

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:55.720
Sadness... That's what... did this to me...?

00:15:57.490 --> 00:15:59.720
Jeel... I...

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:12.900
Useless trash.

00:16:20.430 --> 00:16:22.020
Lag, go!

00:16:22.640 --> 00:16:26.130
I don't have enough heart left to shoot.

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:28.780
You have to finish off the Cabernet!

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:31.500
But I can't form a shindan...

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:33.010
Believe in yourself, Lag!

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:37.260
Your heart... What is it you want to deliver?

00:16:50.180 --> 00:16:51.860
There is no need to worry.

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:57.210
Lead these children to the same place as the 
others who were not able to become spirit.

00:16:57.210 --> 00:16:58.910
That place is safe, yes?

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:01.250
Of course.

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:07.020
Shindan Loaded!

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:15.170
I believe I told you. You need to 
use the power of hatred instead...

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:21.680
That isn't the heart I want to deliver!

00:17:22.740 --> 00:17:23.730
I...

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:36.630
Gauche's Gymnopédie?

00:17:40.150 --> 00:17:41.580
The Spirit Amber is...

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:53.370
There is one thing I've 
wished for all this time...

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:56.250
To meet Gauche once again.

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:58.590
To meet the Gauche who I became 
friends with back then...

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:03.600
Even if there is anger and hatred within me,

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:06.430
they aren't going to become my power!

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:10.310
I... I believe in my own heart!

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:44.850
Gauche told me about it before...

00:18:45.660 --> 00:18:48.350
He said that the base of the 
wings was its weak point...

00:18:51.050 --> 00:18:52.100
Gauche?

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:52.980
Roda...

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:46.620
Next: Smile of Hope
